Each case used a fresh ReShiki source tab, imported CC through the Import UI, applied cleanup, and displayed the source at 250%. The left carbon was selected, Enter opened the label editor, MeO was entered, and Enter applied it. The whole molecule was copied with Cmd+A/Cmd+C. ChemDraw used a new document, and its Change Settings dialog was brought forward through Window and answered **As Copied**. The ChemDraw view was magnified three times for the screenshot, then Cmd+A/Cmd+C copied the result back into another fresh ReShiki tab. Return tabs displayed at 100%.

